<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>社团 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%A4%BE%E5%9B%A2/</link><description>Recent content in 社团 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%A4%BE%E5%9B%A2/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>社团与学生会</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/study/student-clubs-leadership/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/study/student-clubs-leadership/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;美国大学的社团（&lt;code&gt;student club&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;student org&lt;/code&gt;）是&lt;strong&gt;半个职场&lt;/strong&gt;：要注册、要报批、要报账、要拉赞助、要办活动申请场地。想当干部（&lt;code&gt;officer&lt;/code&gt;），英语要能应付三件事：&lt;strong&gt;开会推动议程、跟学校行政部门打交道、对外拉赞助&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>